# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following gate methods have been removed in favor of more established\n"
"methods that append the same gates:\n"
msgstr "تم حذف دوال البوابات التالية لصالح دوال أكثر شيوعاً تُضيف البوابات ذاتها:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Removed                      | Alternative |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.cnot`        | [`QuantumCircuit.cx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cx)       |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.toffoli`     | [`QuantumCircuit.ccx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#ccx)     |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.fredkin`     | [`QuantumCircuit.cswap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cswap) |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.mct`         | [`QuantumCircuit.mcx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#mcx)     |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.i`           | [`QuantumCircuit.id`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#id)       |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.squ`         | [`QuantumCircuit.unitary`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#unitary) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| المحذوف                      | البديل |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.cnot`        | [`QuantumCircuit.cx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cx)       |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.toffoli`     | [`QuantumCircuit.ccx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#ccx)     |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.fredkin`     | [`QuantumCircuit.cswap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cswap) |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.mct`         | [`QuantumCircuit.mcx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#mcx)     |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.i`           | [`QuantumCircuit.id`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#id)       |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.squ`         | [`QuantumCircuit.unitary`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#unitary) |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following circuit methods have been removed. Instead, these gates can be\n"
"applied to a circuit with `QuantumCircuit.append`.\n"
msgstr "تم حذف دوال الدائرة التالية أيضاً. يمكن بدلاً منها إضافة هذه البوابات إلى الدائرة باستخدام `QuantumCircuit.append`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Removed                      | Alternative (append) |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.diagonal`    | [`DiagonalGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.DiagonalGate)          |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.hamiltonian` | [`HamiltonianGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.HamiltonianGate)    |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.isometry`    | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.iso`         | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.uc`          | [`UCGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCGate)               |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrx`        | [`UCRXGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRXGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucry`        | [`UCRYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRYGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrz`        | [`UCRZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRZGate)           |\n"
msgstr ""
"| المحذوف                      | البديل (باستخدام append) |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.diagonal`    | [`DiagonalGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.DiagonalGate)          |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.hamiltonian` | [`HamiltonianGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.HamiltonianGate)    |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.isometry`    | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.iso`         | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.uc`          | [`UCGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCGate)               |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrx`        | [`UCRXGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRXGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucry`        | [`UCRYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRYGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrz`        | [`UCRZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRZGate)           |\n"

